# Vulnerabilities accepted for this repository. Unfixed findings are already ignored by the
# workflow (ignore-unfixed), so an entry here is a fixed vulnerability we have chosen not to
# act on yet. One per entry: a comment line with the reason, then the id with an expiry.
# Example:
#   # false positive: the vulnerable code path is not reachable from the sandbox server
#   CVE-2026-00000 exp:2026-12-31
